19
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:20,240
The defendant, Yuji Itadori, stands
accused of committing the following crime.

20
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,600
On July 16th, 2017,

21
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:27,880
the defendant entered Maji Vegas Pachinko
Parlor, Sendai City, Miyagi Prefecture,

22
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,259
despite being under the
legal age of 18 at the time.

23
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,530
Huh?

24
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:42,937
Within this domain, Judge Man knows all
who've entered and everything they've done.

25
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:45,020
But don't worry yourself too much.

26
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,997
