33
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:11,167
Nevertheless, it will
remain a secret to you.

34
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:14,117
Knowing that, you must
now present your argument.

35
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:18,612
Your goal is to clear suspicion and
win an innocent verdict from Judge Man.

36
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,620
A court trial technique?

37
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,460
That badge.

38
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,860
So he really was a defense lawyer.

39
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:31,069
But isn't he acting
like a prosecutor here?

40
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,677
Higuruma is a modern sorcerer.

41
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,407
This domain is like what
Tengen talked about.

42
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:41,157
Domains used to be a much
more standard skill set for

43
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:44,240
