to today's attacks.

46
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:53,077
Modern domains have become
guaranteed to be deadlier.

47
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:56,377
The guarantee was that
users' techniques would

48
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:59,377
without question hit their
target within the domain.

49
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:03,240
That used to be the commonplace
function of domains in the past.

50
